                "box": {
                    "code": "Data Buf(44100);\r\nHistory bufIndex(0);\r\n\r\ncurrInput = in1;\r\ntime_ms = in2;\r\nT60_ms = in3;\r\nmix = dbtoa((in4-1)*60);\r\n\r\ntimeFeedbackFactor = clip(time_ms * 0.01 + 1, 1, 2.5);\r\nfeedback = pow(10, -3 * time_ms / (T60_ms * timeFeedbackFactor));\r\n\r\ntime_samp = samplerate * time_ms * 0.001;\r\nreadIndex = wrap(bufIndex - time_samp, 0, 44100); \r\n\r\ndelayOutput = peek(Buf, readIndex);\r\ndelayInput = currInput + delayOutput * feedback;\r\n\r\npoke(Buf, delayInput, bufIndex);\r\nbufIndex = wrap(bufIndex + 1, 44100);\r\n\r\n\r\nout1 = (1-mix)* currInput + delayOutput * mix;\r\nout2 = timeFeedbackFactor;\r\nout3 = feedback;",
